        {
          "before": "the tracking certificate $V_\\delta$ shrinking by the factor $\\rho$ per step where those domain conditions hold.",
          "after": "the tracking certificate $V_\\delta$ shrinking by the factor $\\rho$ per step. Here we adopt the typed-domain reading of Assumption 1: the contraction clause includes $x^+\\in X$, so that its left-hand side is defined on the stated domain of $V_\\delta$. The paper does not display this membership as a separate clause; an extension of $V_\\delta$ to the full state space would need a separate successor-domain hypothesis. This supplies a local one-step domain condition; shifted-plan feasibility is proved separately."
        }
